cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its associated research-engineering materials, please cite this project."
type: software
title: "Agentic AI for Reduced-Order ICP Plasma Process Monitoring, Fault Diagnosis and Constrained Operating-Point Optimisation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Gazi"
    given-names: "Md Ashraful Alam"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research-engineering project for a synthetic reduced-order
  argon inductively coupled plasma system, spanning surrogate modelling,
  process monitoring and fault diagnosis, constrained operating-point
  optimisation, and deterministic human-approved agentic decision support.
keywords:
  - "inductively coupled plasma"
  - "reduced-order modelling"
  - "plasma modelling"
  - "surrogate modelling"
  - "fault diagnosis"
  - "constrained optimisation"
  - "agentic AI"
  - "reproducible research"
